          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "Connecting a multi-vendor stack that spans **ERP (SAP, MYOB Acumatica)**, **CRM (e.g., Salesforce, HubSpot, or Dynamics 365)**, and **Microsoft 365** requires an integration partner that understands both deep enterprise back-office architectures and modern cloud API/iPaaS middleware.\n\nThe leading system integration specialists in Sydney well suited for this technical mix can be categorized by their core platform strengths:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Dual-Platform ERP & Integration Specialists (SAP + MYOB Acumatica)\n\n* **Leverage Technologies** *(Sydney CBD - Bridge Street)*\n  * **Why them:** They are one of the few Australian partners with dual accreditation: **MYOB Acumatica Platinum Partner** and **SAP Gold Partner** (covering SAP Business One and SAP S/4HANA Cloud).\n  * **Best for:** Projects where MYOB Acumatica and SAP coexist (e.g., subsidiary/division structures, migration phases, or 2-tier ERP deployments) and need direct API synchronization with CRMs and Microsoft 365.\n  * **Capabilities:** In-house integration architects, ERP custom development, EDI, and CRM syncing.\n\n* **Eagle360 Consulting** *(Sydney)*\n  * **Why them:** A certified **MYOB Acumatica Partner** that is simultaneously a **Microsoft Solutions Partner**. \n  * **Best for:** Tightly aligning MYOB Acumatica with the Microsoft ecosystem (Microsoft 365, Power Automate, Dataverse, and Dynamics 365 CRM/ERP).\n  * **Capabilities:** End-to-end API integration, Power Platform automations, and custom middleware connecting third-party CRMs and external ERPs.\n\n* **Kilimanjaro Consulting / Enprise Group** *(Sydney / North Sydney)*\n  * **Why them:** The largest and most established MYOB Enterprise Diamond Partner in ANZ.\n  * **Best for:** Complex MYOB Acumatica (formerly MYOB Advanced) implementations requiring API integration into upstream CRMs (Salesforce, HubSpot) and enterprise datawarehouses or parent-company SAP instances.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Pure-Play System Integrators & Middleware (iPaaS) Specialists\n\nIf the goal is to orchestrate complex, real-time data flows across SAP, Acumatica, CRM, and Microsoft 365 using enterprise middleware (like Boomi, Celigo, MuleSoft, or Azure Integration Services), dedicated integration consultancies are often the best fit:\n\n* **MyIntegrator** *(Australia-wide / Sydney delivery)*\n  * **Why them:** Specializes purely in multi-point application integration. They feature ready-built and custom connectors specifically covering **MYOB Acumatica**, **SAP / SAP Business One**, major **CRMs**, and eCommerce endpoints.\n  * **Best for:** Fast-turnaround, structured middleware connectors without hiring separate platform-specific consultancies.\n\n* **IntegrationWorks** *(Sydney office)*\n  * **Why them:** One of ANZ’s leading pure-play integration and API management consultancies.\n  * **Best for:** High-volume, enterprise-grade architecture. If your SAP implementation is enterprise (S/4HANA) and needs secure, governable API connectivity across cloud CRM, Microsoft 365 Graph APIs, and mid-market ERPs.\n\n* **Adaptiv** *(Sydney presence)*\n  * **Why them:** A top-tier Boomi Platinum Partner and Microsoft Azure Integration specialist.\n  * **Best for:** Businesses implementing an iPaaS strategy (Boomi or Azure Logic Apps) to connect SAP, MYOB Acumatica, and the Microsoft 365 suite under a single managed integration bus.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Microsoft-Centric System Integrators (for Power Platform & M365 Orchestration)\n\nIf **Microsoft 365** and Azure will serve as the connective backbone (using **Azure Integration Services**, **Power Automate**, and **Microsoft Graph API**):\n\n* **Velrada / Avanade / Empired (Capgemini)** *(Sydney)*\n  * Strong Microsoft Designated Partners capable of building custom connectors in Azure and Power Apps to pull/push data between SAP, MYOB Acumatica, and Microsoft 365 apps (Teams, Outlook, SharePoint).\n\n---\n\n### Recommended Selection Criteria:\n1. **If MYOB Acumatica and SAP must speak to each other:** Contact **Leverage Technologies** first, as their consultants actively support and deploy both systems in-house.\n2. **If Microsoft 365 / Dynamics is your primary CRM & workflow hub:** Speak to **Eagle360 Consulting** or a Microsoft Azure integration partner.\n3. **If you have multiple CRMs/eCommerce tools and need an iPaaS pipeline:** Evaluate **MyIntegrator** or **Adaptiv** to deploy a Boomi or Celigo architecture.",
              "thoughtSignature": ""
